<section>
  <h2>Our story</h2>
  <p>Siliguri Security Services Pvt. Ltd. was founded in <strong>{{ site.founded }}</strong> in Matigara, Siliguri, with twenty guards and a single idea: deliver corporate-grade security with the discipline and personal accountability of a family business. Today, {{ site.yearsActive }} years on, we operate {{ site.stats.personnel }} trained personnel across {{ site.stats.clientLocations }} client sites in North Bengal, the Darjeeling Hills, the Dooars, Jalpaiguri, Alipurduar, and Sikkim — and we deploy on contract across India.</p>

  <p>The discipline that defined us from year one is the discipline that defines us today: every guard is fully trained, statutory-compliant from day one, and supervised by a real human being who can be reached on a phone number, not a ticket queue.</p>
</section>

