<section>
  <h2>Core values</h2>
  <ul class="check-list">
    <li><strong>Statutory compliance, no shortcuts.</strong> Every guard on every site is on our payroll with EPF, ESI, bonus and gratuity provisioning — and we can produce challans on request.</li>
    <li><strong>Director-led accountability.</strong> Our director is reachable for enterprise escalations. No call-centre, no ticket-shuffle.</li>
    <li><strong>Local first.</strong> Our guards live in the communities they serve. They speak the languages your facility uses, and they know the local geography.</li>
    <li><strong>Transparent pricing.</strong> Tier rates published. Statutory contributions itemised. No hidden mark-ups in renewals.</li>
    <li><strong>Honest scope.</strong> If your site needs more (or fewer) guards than you asked for, we will tell you on day one — even if it costs us the contract.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

